# React & Tailwind Standards
- Use functional components with arrow functions.
- Always use the custom theme variables: --color-brand for primary actions and --color-secondary for muted text.
- Follow a modular component structure.
- Use 'lucide-react' for icons if available.
- Prioritize clean, minimalist AMOLED-style UI (bg-slate-950).
- When creating forms, use 'react-hook-form' and the custom 'FormInput' component.